| Tool | Purpose | Notes |
|------|---------|-------|
| **NASM** | Assembler | Converts assembly to machine code |
| **GCC Cross-Compiler** | C compiler | Must target bare metal, not host OS |
| **LD** | Linker | Controls memory layout via linker scripts |
| **QEMU** | Emulator | Test without physical hardware |
| **dd** | Disk imaging | Creates raw disk images |
| **xorriso** | ISO creation | Creates bootable CD/USB images |

### Cross-Compiler Target
- `i686-elf` for 32-bit
- `x86_64-elf` for 64-bit
- Must be "freestanding" — no standard library, no OS assumptions

